{"asset_key":"ep1/quest_story_11104260","episode":"ep1","category":"quest_story","story_id":"11104260","schema_version":1,"lang":"kr","texts":{"say:1:1110426001:0":{"text":"칼라, 저희가 제때 왔어요!","source_cn":"曼卡拉，我们及时赶来啦！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x3FA0C75BD060F24A","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:2:1110426002:1":{"text":"그럼 세 번째 시련, 이제 시작해볼까?","source_cn":"第三项试炼，现在开始吗？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xC7673A1C531B3B17","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1110426003:1":{"text":"아직 시간도 남았고, 도전자 한 명이 아직 도착하지 않아서, 시련을 시작할 수 없어요.","source_cn":"目前还有时间，而且有一位挑战者尚未到达，所以现在试炼还...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xDA91439CBEC1A159","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1110426004:1":{"text":"그래? 그럼 아르사, 우리 쉴 곳을 찾아보자...","source_cn":"是吗？那阿尔萨，我们找个地方休息——","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xDA9A9B1F269B3785","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1110426005:1":{"text":"쉿! 잠시만요. 이 칼라의 부탁 하나 들어주시겠어요?","source_cn":"嘘！稍等我一会，曼卡拉有件事想拜托你们！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x5332FF0EBBC43092","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","documen